{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415038","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415038","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041503801:1":{"text":"혼자서 술 먹는 건 너답지 않네, 소니아.","source_cn":"一个人喝酒，这可不像你，索尼娅。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38DE9DF7D2FC59A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503802:1":{"text":"새 친구 사귀는 걸 거절하지 마. 언젠가는 모두를 상대해야 하는 날이 있을 거야.","source_cn":"别拒绝交新朋友，大家总有打交道的那天。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4D2C6DF29590E79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503803:1":{"text":"난 너와 달라. 언제든지 쥐를 본 고양이처럼 그들을 놀릴 수 있지.","source_cn":"我不像你，随时都能像看到耗子的猫一样逗他们玩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B37D3CAB8B2A9D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503804:1":{"text":"잠깐... 이거 칭찬이야? 아님 욕이야?","source_cn":"等等……你这是在夸我还是在骂我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x141B8AD2AAAFE5AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503805:1":{"text":"나도 가끔은 혼자서 술 마시는 시간도 필요해. ","source_cn":"我偶尔也需要一点自己喝酒的时间。你请便。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x476F9BEE8E958240","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041503806:1":{"text":"이봐, 그거 알아? 그렇게 말하면 더 가기 싫어진다니까.","source_cn":"嘿，知道吗？你越是这么说，我就越不想走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7152CBAF843FB549","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041503807:1":{"text":"럼에다 불피아의 즙, 그리고 스노우드롭을 넣은 칵테일 레시피를 알고 있는데, 어때?","source_cn":"我听说过一个酒方，朗姆加鼠矛草的汁液和清晨的雪露，如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75559A0DA4EC5700","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041503808:1":{"text":"그게 무슨 술인데?","source_cn":"这是什么酒？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA55F68C259FC8AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041503809:1":{"text":"내가 막 만든 거라 이름은 없어. 마셔볼래?","source_cn":"没有名字，我刚调的。要不你起一个？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39991AB34393D84A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041503810:1":{"text":"그럼 “라솔리타”라고 하자.","source_cn":"就叫“拉索丽塔”吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA07CAC8882105DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041503811:1":{"text":"라솔리타? 시에 나온 자유와 고독을 쫓는 그 부랑아 말이야?\n너도 시를 읽다니 의외네.","source_cn":"拉索丽塔？诗歌中追求自由和孤独的流浪儿？\\n看不出来，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6559017EC0597517","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041503812:1":{"text":"그런 표현이 있었다는 건 몰랐어. 단지 나라가 그 이름에 대해 얘기했던 적이 있어서.","source_cn":"原来还有这个说法？我不知道，只是听奈拉提过这个名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58B35B77A3C53191","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041503813:1":{"text":"그만하고, 한잔할까?","source_cn":"不提了，干一杯吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8355244AFB4E995C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041503814:1":{"text":"너를 위해!","source_cn":"敬你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA4FD84A03F7E7E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041503815:1":{"text":"...고독을 위해!","source_cn":"……敬孤独！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54BF812D9A4CA276","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"소니아","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":2}}